3376
01:59:42.135 --> 01:59:44.003
It was a misunderstanding.
It was an argument.

3377
01:59:44.036 --> 01:59:46.139
But we're all friends again.
We worked it out.

3378
01:59:46.172 --> 01:59:47.206
You know how buddies get.

3379
01:59:47.240 --> 01:59:49.242
Dude. I... We-we. we got to
