3429
02:01:22.369 --> 02:01:23.903
He looks like a cop.

3430
02:01:23.936 --> 02:01:25.238
Excuse me. ma'am.

3431
02:01:25.271 --> 02:01:26.473
Ray Bishop. Ladder 57.

3432
02:01:26.506 --> 02:01:28.040
We got to get this guy
