3434
02:01:29.308 --> 02:01:30.977
- Follow me.
- Okay. come on. buddy.

3435
02:01:31.010 --> 02:01:32.111
Come on. come on.
come on. come on. come on.

3436
02:01:32.144 --> 02:01:33.779
Here we go. here we go.
here we go.

3437
02:01:33.813 --> 02:01:36.249
- (man groaning)
- All right.

3438
02:01:36.282 --> 02:01:37.817
