3446
02:01:46.959 --> 02:01:48.227
Let me know if you need trauma.

3447
02:01:48.261 --> 02:01:50.229
- (groans): Oh. shit.
- Okay. Here we go.

3448
02:01:50.263 --> 02:01:53.132
- Nice and easy. nice and easy.
