I-I was just helping him.

3454
02:02:07.913 --> 02:02:09.048
Yeah. Scott brought him in.

3455
02:02:09.081 --> 02:02:11.017
You know. guy just kind of
wandered into the firehouse

3456
02:02:11.050 --> 02:02:12.018
