3471
02:02:58.498 --> 02:03:00.099
(Margie sighs)

3472
02:03:10.477 --> 02:03:11.977
Nah.

3473
02:03:13.112 --> 02:03:15.482
SCOTT: Yeah. I. um...
I can never get the eyes right

3474
02:03:15.515 --> 02:03:17.883
'cause I-I just make them
