3478
02:03:25.359 --> 02:03:26.992
There's not any. like.
Chinese characters

3479
02:03:27.026 --> 02:03:28.894
or anything back there.
is there?

3480
02:03:29.563 --> 02:03:31.197
No. no.

3481
02:03:31.230 --> 02:03:32.098
No. no. no.

3482
02:03:32.131 --> 02:03:33.500
