3509
02:04:29.088 --> 02:04:30.956
Yeah. Yeah.

3510
02:04:32.592 --> 02:04:35.161
Well. he was hilarious.

3511
02:04:35.194 --> 02:04:36.730
Yeah.

3512
02:04:36.763 --> 02:04:38.297
Uh...

3513
